erent field etc  so i think it again decision making  pervades human life so there's no field  that it does not but this  framework does not apply to you in the  abstract so i think it applies to  anything  and i think that's a great note for us  to finish on  thank you very much brad thank you  stuart thanks for the opportunity  enjoyed it thanks everyone for all of  your feedback and energy  yeah and if you go ahead and share the  next  slide we have an upcoming webinar  next tuesday another simple learn  webinar  and this one is a career oriented  especially oriented towards new grads  expert tips for a successful career  redefining future readiness for the  modern graduate and this is  the vice chancellor of the srm institute  of science and technology  dr sandeep sinchetti  so we hope you will join us for that  webinar  and we hope that you have found today's  webinar useful  and you can connect to simplylearn using  our various  uh social media handles i think that's  on the next library  and we are on facebook twitter and  linkedin  and brad people can connect with you on  linkedin yes  yes wonderful so  um again that concludes our webinar  today we hope to see you at the next one  i want to thank brad powley again for  giving us these insights into  decision analysis and how it makes you a  better data scientist  and um i'd like to ask everyone at this  point to please  log off of webex there will be a survey  that pops up  and if you can take a couple moments to  answer those survey questions that will  be helpful  thank you again goodbye everyone  [Music]  you
 

